    {
      "id": "product-page-moldboard-metric-conflict",
      "status": "documented",
      "detail": "The U.S. product page pairs the label 12 ft with 4267 mm, which is approximately 14 ft. Current North American publication AEXQ4628-01 gives the 12 ft moldboard width as 3658 mm. This candidate uses 3658 mm and does not silently adopt the product-page metric."
