      "detail": "The product page displays 19,531 kg typically equipped, while AEXQ4628-01 identifies the frozen lever/non-AWD typically equipped configuration as 19,027 kg. The candidate records the configuration-specific PDF value; no mass is inferred from model geometry."
    },
    {
      "id": "admitted-pdf-operating-weight-precedence",
      "status": "documented",
      "detail": "AEXQ4475-00 page 3 gives 19,127 kg for a typically equipped lever non-AWD machine, while the later North-American-family AEXQ4628-01 page 4 gives 19,027 kg for the frozen lever/non-AWD basis. The candidate uses AEXQ4628-01 for that conflicting configuration fact and uses AEXQ4475-00 only for nonconflicting detailed geometry and motion facts. Geometry makes no mass claim."
    },
    {
      "id": "admitted-pdf-moldboard-dimension-precedence",
      "status": "documented",
      "detail": "AEXQ4475-00 page 4 contains differing 12 ft moldboard height/throat rows, including 609.5 mm, 535.3 mm, 553.6 mm and 125 mm labels. AEXQ4628-01 page 4 explicitly gives 556 mm height including cutting edges and 119 mm non-HPC throat clearance for the current North American family. The frozen candidate therefore uses AEXQ4628-01 for width, height, thickness, arc radius and throat clearance; AEXQ4475-00 is subordinate for those conflicts."
    },
